00:29:34.220 --> 00:29:36.260
Dia bilang akan mengikuti aturan, kenapa dia kabur?

00:29:38.140 --> 00:29:39.930
Saya harap dia tidak tertangkap

00:29:42.940 --> 00:29:44.350
Baru saja pergi

00:29:44.940 --> 00:29:45.940
Baru saja

